          {
            "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boxing_Day",
            "title": "Boxing Day - Wikipedia",
            "quote": "it was a custom for tradesmen to collect \"Christmas boxes\" of money or presents"
          }
        ],
        "confidence": "high"
      },
      {
        "id": "c2",
        "text": "Samuel Pepys's diary entry for 19 December 1663 mentions the custom.",
